      "text": [
        " اَلصَّلاَةِ وَ أَدْخَلَ يَدَهُ فِي أَنْفِهِ فَأَخْرَجَ دَماً فَأَشَارَ إِلَيْهِ بِيَدِهِ «اُفْرُكْهُ بِيَدِكَ وَ صَلِّ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1054 - Bukayr ibn Ayyan narrated that Imam Muhammad ibn Ali Al-Baqir (as) saw a man who had a nosebleed during prayer. The man put his hand into his nose, took out blood, and the Imam gestured to him with his hand, saying,\n\"Wipe it with your hand and continue praying.\""
        ]
      }
